OL,3,GNEWSAMum who died trying to save sons
OL,4,Awas hero, husband says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe husband of a British woman who died
OL,7,Frescuing their sons when they were
OL,8,Fswept away to sea in the Bahamas says
OL,9,Fshe was a "hero... in life and in
OL,10,Fdeath".
OL,12,FLeanne Gregory, from Stapleford in
OL,13,FNottinghamshire, had been snorkelling
OL,14,Fwith her family when the boys were
OL,15,Fswept away by a strong current, police
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FAlthough the children were rescued from
OL,19,Fthe water off the island of Bimini on
OL,20,FTuesday, their mother was unable to be
OL,21,Fsaved, the Royal Bahamas Police Force
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
